<title>UK: BayerVB adds 50 mln Ecu to Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB adds 50 mln Ecu to Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 150 million Ecu from 100 million Ecu, joint lead managers Byerische Vereinsbank and Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    31.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.385   PAY DATE    04.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.835    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		ORIGINAL 100 MLN ECU LAUNCHED 22.JAN.97 AT 101.237</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
